    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15887" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχεύω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρχω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>command,</i> c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχεύειν Τρώεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.200
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.345
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμάδοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.347
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ παισίν</span> Poet.in<i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1015.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be chief magistrate</i> or <i>official,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρχευκὼς τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					166.3
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Paphos</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1023.87
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cos</span>).</div>
